s://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2022-03-25T22:12:16Z","updated_at":"2022-09-20T06:27:54Z","closed_at":"2022-05-25T19:39:10Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-548](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-548)\r\n### Description\n\nThe ModifyTableIsSingleRowWrite function  \r\nhttps://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/blob/ac03c5e59b81db6a852b90a4310badb8cb5ddac3/src/postgres/src/backend/optimizer/util/ybcplan.c#L60\r\nmay mistake a multi-row modify table statement for a single row.\r\nThe criteria that subplan under the ModifyTable node is a Result node is insufficient. The Result node may be used as a wrapper around a larger subplan to evaluate a one-time condition, and either execute or skip the subplan depending on the result.\r\nExample:\r\n```\r\nyugabyte=# explain insert into test select i, 0, 0 from generate_series(1, 100) i where (((0.14198202)::MONEY)>=((0.14222479)::MONEY));\r\n                                      QUERY PLAN                                      \r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n Insert on test  (cost=0.01..10.01 rows=1000 width=12)\r\n   ->  Result  (cost=0.01..10.01 rows=1000 width=12)\r\n         One-Time Filter: ((0.14198202)::money >= (0.14222479)::money)\r\n         ->  Function Scan on generate_series i  (cost=0.01..10.01 rows=1000 width=4)\r\n(4 rows)\r\n```\r\nAlso function has poorly, even dangerously written comments, implying the limitation are temporary and may be relaxed in future. They may encourage developers to implement unsafe algorithms violating ACID properties.        ","closed_by":{"login":"andrei-mart","id":1223507,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjM1MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1223507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart","html_url":"https://github.com/andrei-mart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/11899/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/11899/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}